Programs are deferred functions that operate on DataTrees. This is implemented as a class Program. Programs essentially shadow the methods available to a DataTree. 

```{python}
prog = Program().expr(
    # expressions
)

prog(dt)
```

Programs can be initialized with a cache, this cache stores a hash of an input, an input, and its corresponding output twig. This only applies when operations can be represented by maps and map_filters, filters that skip iteration, for now just store expressions as programs.

Cache's for now can be implemented as json files, the name should default some hash of the program.

```{python}
prog = Program(cache = FileCache("get_tags"))
```

